      "id": "claim_137d902ccf5540ae804ada3b659156c2",
      "statement": "Initialization uses `init_std` normal initialization for linear and embedding weights, ones for RMSNorm weights, and zero for enabled sink biases; YaRN inverse frequencies are registered as a non-persistent buffer rather than learned parameters.",
