      "statement": "Gradient checkpointing is an opt-in runtime policy: training enables it at the configured cadence, and grad-enabled forward checkpoints blocks whose index is divisible by that cadence with `use_reentrant=False`; no-grad/evaluation bypasses checkpointing.",
