      "id": "claim_2c7460e0770a457cb824714780ed3dff",
      "statement": "The default `moe_dispatch` path is stable PyTorch expert grouping and weighted accumulation; `triton_grouped` is an explicit alternate path that fuses W1/W3 plus SiLU while leaving W2 in PyTorch, so dispatch selection preserves the MoE output contract while changing execution.",
